<title>SINGAPORE: Serial System buys electronic firm stake.</title>
<headline>Serial System buys electronic firm stake.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Serial System Ltd said it had signed an agreement on July 23 to buy a 55 percent stake in Hi-Tech Business Associates Pte Ltd for Singapore $450,000.</p>
<p>In a company statement received on Tuesday, the electronic parts distributor said Hi-Tech Business distributes high-tech, electronic component products and semi-conductors.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 8084)</p>
</text>
